# Urkaaaz — shared low-profile title frame

## Purpose and source

This is the shared Android title-frame asset used by Dashboard, Shop, and
future screen headers. Loadout intentionally retains its separate two-panel
frame because it displays different title and level text. The low-profile
asset's canonical source and runtime paths are
`assets_src/shared/ui/shared_header_frame_low_profile.png` and
`android-app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/shared_header_frame_low_profile.png`.
Both copies must stay byte-identical.

Use the user-approved low-profile frame image as the visual reference. It is a
transparent 2000 × 667 PNG: one long, shallow dark plaque with warm bronze/gold
trim, carved timber, compact iron end fittings, and no lower plaque or tall
side posts. Keep this simple one-panel silhouette for all future revisions.
The title and any subtitle/level information are live UI, not part of the
image. Do not include text, letters, symbols, logos, or a background.

## Prompt

Using the attached approved `shared_header_frame_low_profile.png`, create an
exact style-matched replacement for Dashboard, Shop, and future Urkaaaz
screen headers. Do not replace or imitate the separate two-panel Loadout frame.
Keep one long, low horizontal plaque with the same dark charcoal-brown inset,
shallow warm bronze/gold rails, carved timber, compact symmetrical iron end
fittings, and small rivets. Preserve its low silhouette and broad,
uncluttered live-text area. The frame must work as a flat Android UI overlay
at varied header widths and heights.

Do not redesign it as a stacked banner. Do not add a bottom plaque, subtitle
strip, tall posts, pointed towers, dangling trim, or any vertical extension.
Keep the art centered on transparent canvas with crisp edges and restrained
highlights. The attached image is the approved design; do not introduce new
ornaments or change its established frame silhouette.

## Output

- Output exactly one file: `shared_header_frame_low_profile.png`.
- Canvas: exactly 2000 × 667 pixels, landscape.
- Format: transparent RGBA PNG.
- Preserve the approved frame's low-profile silhouette and wide proportions.
- Preserve transparency everywhere outside the frame.
- Keep the source copy at
  `assets_src/shared/ui/shared_header_frame_low_profile.png`;
  the Android copy belongs at
  `android-app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/shared_header_frame_low_profile.png`.
- Update both copies together and keep them byte-identical.
- Do not include a mockup, screenshot, alternate version, or extra files.

## Negative prompt

lower plaque, second plaque, stacked signboards, subtitle panel, hanging
signboard, dangling plate, tall posts, vertical pillars, pointed towers,
spikes, long supports, bottom extension, text, letters, numbers, logo,
watermark, signature, background, scenery, wall, UI screenshot, buttons,
perspective mockup, bright central panel, oversized ornaments, excessive gold
glow, strong bloom, clutter, asymmetrical frame, clipped artwork, opaque
background

## Acceptance check

1. The output is a transparent 2000 × 667 PNG.
2. Dashboard, Shop, and future screen headers can share this asset; Loadout
   retains its distinct two-panel frame.
3. There is one low horizontal plaque, with no second panel or tall post.
4. The center remains uncluttered for live title and optional level text.
5. Source and Android runtime copies are byte-identical.
